{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0000", "text": "这是我的妈妈。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0001", "text": "他决定搬去芝加哥使我们感到很惊讶。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0002", "text": "老人在騾子的背上放上了一個個裝滿了沙的袋子。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0003", "text": "首先，因为海水变热时膨胀，海平面可能提高。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0004", "text": "在中国，人人必须去出发的火车站买车票。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0005", "text": "你这是在说什么？", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0006", "text": "请说慢一点。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0007", "text": "请说慢一些。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0008", "text": "我是外国人，我捷克语不好，请说慢一点。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0009", "text": "你不抽烟还能活长点。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0010", "text": "实际上他根本没有去考试。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0011", "text": "尼古拉斯和玛利亚彼此相爱。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0012", "text": "我认为我明白了。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0013", "text": "你是干什么工作的？", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0014", "text": "你家有几口人？", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0015", "text": "玛丽长得像她妈妈，但是性格不像。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0016", "text": "他的年收入比他兄弟多。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0017", "text": "我觉得我是按照你说的做的。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0018", "text": "他从不喝酒。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-zh-0019", "text": "她的话没有恶意。", "lang": "zh", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
